      "text": "orchestrator._execute — one transaction\nconsecutive READS share a wave (asyncio.gather)\nconvert_prompt is a barrier · a write runs alone\nevery worker survivable: an unexpected raise becomes\noutcome='error' and a labelled trace node, not a 500",
      "originalText": "orchestrator._execute — one transaction\nconsecutive READS share a wave (asyncio.gather)\nconvert_prompt is a barrier · a write runs alone\nevery worker survivable: an unexpected raise becomes\noutcome='error' and a labelled trace node, not a 500",
