      "text": "_remaining_plan(...) → queued_steps\nthe writes behind the card ride on the pending row\nunqueued = deferred writes with no card to ride on",
      "originalText": "_remaining_plan(...) → queued_steps\nthe writes behind the card ride on the pending row\nunqueued = deferred writes with no card to ride on",
