      "updated": 1787215428278,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Plan-Then-Execute, Deck 5 p40: the plan is fixed\nbefore any tool output exists, so nothing a retrieved\nprompt body says can add a step.\n\nSupervisor–worker, Deck 3 p17-19, as a function and\nnot a graph library — A-012, debuggable by one person.\n\nNothing in orchestrator.py writes. The two write paths\nare confirm_action and run_queued_step, and both need\na person's recorded decision first.",
      "originalText": "Plan-Then-Execute, Deck 5 p40: the plan is fixed\nbefore any tool output exists, so nothing a retrieved\nprompt body says can add a step.\n\nSupervisor–worker, Deck 3 p17-19, as a function and\nnot a graph library — A-012, debuggable by one person.\n\nNothing in orchestrator.py writes. The two write paths\nare confirm_action and run_queued_step, and both need\na person's recorded decision first.",
      "fontSize": 21,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
